TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-0910.0096v1
AU  - Chen, Yuqun
AU  - Liu, Cihua
TI  - Gröbner-Shirshov bases for Coxeter groups I∗
DA  - D:20211127
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0910.0096
AB  - A conjecture of Gr¨obner-Shirshov basis of any Coxeter group has proposed by L.A. Bokut and L.-S. Shiao [4]. In this paper, we give an example to show that the conjecture is not true in general. We list all possible nontrivial inclusion compositions when we deal with the general cases of the Coxeter groups. We give a Gr¨obner-Shirshov basis of a Coxeter group which is without nontrivial inclusion compositions mentioned the above.
ER  - 
